From 4b07e9cbfb3bb074029935099947d420fdcc36fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cliffhall <cliff@futurescale.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 23:32:44 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix: resolve the findings the root ESLint config reports

The type-aware root config reports 175 findings across the four TS servers
and 4 in the root tooling; each is fixed rather than suppressed: explicit
types for every any/Function in the tests (via SDK types and a small
typed helper module in everything's __tests__), unused imports and
variables removed, caught errors given a cause, empty catches explained,
floating promises held or voided with a reason, and filesystem's tools
now publish their named zod schemas' shapes instead of hand-copied
duplicates (identical fields, so the input schemas are unchanged).

Refs #4864

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: cliffhall <cliff@futurescale.com>
